ahoma-governor-republican-runoff">Oklahoma Governor, GOP runoff</a></h3><span class="eye" style="margin-left:auto">Aug 25</span></div><div class="card-b"><div class="res-row"><i style="background:#ffb3c0;opacity:0.4"></i><span>Gentner Drummond</span><span class="pct">…</span><span class="votes"></span></div><div class="res-row"><i style="background:#ffb3c0;opacity:0.4"></i><span>Mike Mazzei</span><span class="pct">…</span><span class="votes"></span></div><div class="prog"><i style="width:0"></i></div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:6px">Loading the final count</div></div></div><div class="card count"><div class="card-b"><div class="eye">Next election night</div><div class="bignum" style="margin-top:8px">Nov 3</div><div class="n" aria-live="off"><div><b class="mono">·</b><span>days</span></div><div><b class="mono">·</b><span>hrs</span></div><div><b class="mono">·</b><span>min</span></div></div><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:12px">County maps, call log, live model updates and the stream from the On Point Polling situation room.</div><a class="btn white" style="margin-top:14px" href="/results/tonight">Open the live desk</a></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="sec-h"><div><div class="eye g">From On Point Polling</div><h2>Latest releases and model notes</h2></div><a class="btn more" href="/on-point-polling/polls">All releases</a></div><div class="grid4"><a class="card story" href="/on-point-polling/polls/texas-2026"><div class="thumb"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 180" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="320" height="180" fill="#120820"></rect><g font-family="var(--font-m)" font-size="11" fill="#c9c2d6"><text x="20" y="44">SENATE</text><text x="20" y="104">GOVERNOR</text></g><rect x="20" y="54" width="280" height="14" rx="7" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.07)"></rect><rect x="20" y="54" width="137" height="14" rx="7" fill="#3d7bff"></rect><rect x="180" y="54" width="120" height="14" rx="7" fill="#ff3b5c"></rect><rect 